: 12px;\">O evento decorre no fim de semana de 21 e 22 de novembro de 2026: Conflu\u00eancia Kids no s\u00e1bado \u00e0s 15h00 e as provas de Trail (34k, 25k, 15k) e Caminhada (10k) no domingo a partir das 08h30.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se localiza o secretariado e centro do evento?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no Espa\u00e7o Cidad\u00e3o de Const\u00e2ncia e as partidas\/chegadas decorrem na acolhedora Zona Ribeirinha junto ao rio.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">A prova est\u00e1 inserida em algum trof\u00e9u oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, o Conflu\u00eancia Trail integra o circuito oficial 3 Rios Trail Trophy.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui a taxa de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Inclui dorsal personalizado, chip eletr\u00f3nico, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, seguro de acidentes pessoais, banhos e lembran\u00e7a finisher oficial.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem at\u00e9 15 de novembro de 2026 na plataforma Stopandgo (www.stopandgo.net).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Conflu\u00eancia Trail 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Zona Ribeirinha, Const\u00e2ncia\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Const\u00e2ncia\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"C\u00e2mara Municipal de Const\u00e2ncia\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza o Conflu\u00eancia Trail 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento decorre no fim de semana de 21 e 22 de novembro de 2026: Conflu\u00eancia Kids no s\u00e1bado \u00e0s 15h00 e as provas de Trail (34k, 25k, 15k) e Caminhada (10k) no domingo a partir das 08h30.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se localiza o secretariado e centro do evento?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona no Espa\u00e7o Cidad\u00e3o de Const\u00e2ncia e as partidas\/chegadas decorrem na acolhedora Zona Ribeirinha junto ao rio.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"A prova est\u00e1 inserida em algum trof\u00e9u oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, o Conflu\u00eancia Trail integra o circuito oficial 3 Rios Trail Trophy.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"O que inclui a taxa de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Inclui dorsal personalizado, chip eletr\u00f3nico, abastecimentos s\u00f3lidos e l\u00edquidos, seguro de acidentes pessoais, banhos e lembran\u00e7a finisher oficial.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais decorrem at\u00e9 15 de novembro de 2026 na plataforma Stopandgo (www.stopandgo.net).\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":51776,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498],"event_type_2":[727,820,39],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[823],"class_list":["post-51775","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-constancia-santarem","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal","event_type_2-santarem","event_type_5-circuito-atrp"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/06\/2026-05-01_18-00-25_69f4dc298cd09.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/51775","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\